#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
CodeEfficiencyAnalyzer v18.0 – Expanded Java Vuln Patches, Added C++ Autofix, Refactored jAST Transformers
Improvements:
- Expanded Java vuln patches: SQLi (replace Statement with PreparedStatement), XSS (add escape), XXE (disable entities), Deserialization (add validation), RCE (comment Runtime.exec)
- Added C++ autofix: clang-format for formatting, clang-tidy --fix for lints/smells/unused
- Refactored jAST: Separate transformer classes (ImportRemover, VulnPatcher, CatchFixer, etc.), chained application
- Heuristics: Severity priority (vulns > smells > format)
- Assumes clang-format/clang-tidy for C++ (install via package manager)
"""

